    "section": "<p>Measuring liquid dispensing</p>",
    "section_color": "#94EBFF",
    "section_duration": 0,
    "is_substep": false,
    "step": "Put tip onto pipette by taking micropipette, placing the shaft into the desired tip and pushing while twisting slightly. \n\nYou do not need to hammer or slam the micropipettor into the tip to get it to stay.\n \n\n\n**Always** use tips on micropipettors!\n \n",
    "data": null,
