    "section": "<p>Measuring liquid dispensing</p>",
    "section_color": "#94EBFF",
    "section_duration": 0,
    "is_substep": false,
    "step": "Allow the plunger to go to the up position. Depress the plunger to the first stop to eject the liquid, then allow the plunger to return to the up position. This is called &#34;pre-rinsing&#34;.\n\nThe pre-rinse liquid can be ejected to waste as well if desired or to avoid contamination. In general, pre-rinsing should be down with each new tip or volume. \n \n",
    "data": null,
